    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eA type of monster found only in underground labyrinths. Two of its ten tentacles are poisonous It feeds on the bodily fluids of still living creatures. Since it has no teeth, it’ll first paralyze prey with its tentacles, before slipping said tentacles inside its victim’s body to eat away at it from the inside.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne was seen in \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Sword_Of_The_Unicorn\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade: Sword Of The Unicorn\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade: Sword Of The Unicorn\u003c/a\u003e chapter 4.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131628\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--\u003e\n\u003c!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n--\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39501-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821131628 and revision id 64412. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n --\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e"
